	(text "L2 10 µH (same part as L1) + C30 / C31: a pi filter\nof its own for the IMU and screen converters, so the screen's\n20 W converter neither loads nor disturbs the logic supply\n(L1, Power sheet). Load at 24 V: IMU ≤ 0.5 A + screen ≤ 0.95 A\n≈ 1.45 A; L2 is rated 2.1 A (2.9 A saturation).\nBoth converters are isolated: input side on GND_24V,\noutput side on GND (same scheme as the logic DC/DC)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 68.58 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "7b8ed9a4-9818-51b8-8e4f-d12ac977677f")
	)
