	(text "Same parts as the MES3.1-Carrier-LH \"IMU Power Supply @ 9V\":\nU9 YLPTEC URB2409S-10WR3 (9-36 V in, 9 V 1.11 A, 10 W isolated, short-circuit protected;\nMES3.1 U15), C32 47 µF / 100 V and C33 22 µF / 16 V (the datasheet's Cin / Cout),\nSW2 SS12D10G5 slide switch (MES3.1 U22, common = pin 2), J14 KF250NH 2-pin (MES3.1 CN10).\nCTRL open = on. SW2 is rated 0.5 A: check the IMU draws less (the converter gives up to 1.11 A).\nLED8 green (+ R43 2.2k, 3.2 mA) sits after SW2: it lights only when the IMU terminal is powered.\nLCSC stock of URB2409S-10WR3 is low (78 on 2026-10-27): order early."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 124.46 68.58 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "bd418bf5-22b4-53fc-9365-4c5019b2d42b")
	)
